<string name="crash_report_dialog_message">
    Help us make the app better!
    &lt;br>&lt;br>
    When the app crashes, we can send anonymized technical data:
    &lt;br>
    &#8226; Device model and Android version&lt;br>
    &#8226; App version&lt;br>
    &#8226; Error log (stack trace)
    &lt;br>&lt;br>
    What we &lt;b>DO NOT&lt;/b> collect:
    &lt;br>
    &#8226; No personal data&lt;br>
    &#8226; No location or usage data
    &lt;br>&lt;br>
    The data is encrypted and stored on a server in Germany.
    &lt;br>&lt;br>
    &lt;b>For more details, please see our &lt;a href="https://docs.kolibri-launcher.ch/privacy.html">Privacy Policy&lt;/a>.&lt;/b>
</string>

